        "inside a method that awaited the thread pool: off the context, with none, on another thread",
        "back in its caller: on the context",
        "after ConfigureAwait(true) on a ValueTask of 9: on the context"
      ],
      "stderr": [],
      "exitCode": 0
    }
  },
